From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philip Balister <philip@balister.org>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] QtCore: Drop QEvent::EnterEditFocus and LeaveEditFocus

Qt 6.13 removed these keypad-navigation event types, so the generated
QEvent wrapper fails to compile against it:

  sipQtCoreQEvent.cpp:624:57: error: 'EnterEditFocus' is not a member of 'QEvent'

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [PyQt6 6.11 targets Qt <= 6.11; drop once PyQt6 supports Qt 6.13]

Signed-off-by: Philip Balister <philip@balister.org>
---
--- a/sip/QtCore/qcoreevent.sip
+++ b/sip/QtCore/qcoreevent.sip
@@ -200,8 +200,6 @@
         PlatformSurface,
         TabletTrackingChange,
         GraphicsSceneLeave,
-        EnterEditFocus,
-        LeaveEditFocus,
 %If (Qt_6_6_0 -)
         DevicePixelRatioChange,
 %End
